###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Energy and force RMSEs on stationary points and test sets are shown only as relative errors in Fig. 2 and in Supplementary Tables S2-S5, which are not in the PDF; counts of unphysical and matched stationary points (Figs. 3, 4) are not error metrics.
# - The system-specific models are trained per molecule with the hyperparameters of their original publications (not restated); each run stands for six per-molecule models. SO3LR is a new registry method (method paper not in the corpus); GFN2-xTB is semi-empirical and not encoded.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/carare2025.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
